  <p>These Terms apply to all services we provide: consulting, software and web development, system integration, maintenance, and software tools we license or operate for you (the "Services"). By accepting a proposal, paying an invoice, opening a customer account or using one of our tools, you ("you", the "Customer") agree to these Terms, our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> and our <a href="/refund">Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</a>. If you act on behalf of an organisation, you confirm that you are authorised to bind it. A signed proposal or statement of work prevails over these Terms where they conflict.</p>

