    <li>Invoices are payable within 15 days through the payment link we send or the customer portal. Amounts below the payment provider's minimum are carried forward to the next invoice.</li>
    <li>Online payments are processed by <b><%= co.PAY.legalName %></b> as our authorised reseller and Merchant of Record. <%= co.PAY.name %> issues the receipt, collects applicable taxes and handles payment, refund and chargeback matters under the <a href="<%= co.PAY.buyerTermsUrl %>" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><%= co.PAY.name %> Buyer Terms</a>.</li>
    <li>If an invoice remains unpaid after its due date we may pause work, suspend access to tools or portals, and withhold deliverables until payment is received.</li>
    <li>Changes to recurring prices (maintenance plans, unit prices for tools) are announced by email at least 30 days in advance.</li>
